msgid "How to connect Airbnb and Booking.com"
msgstr "Kako povezati Airbnb i Booking.com"

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Import (OTA → website): in Airbnb (Availability › Connect calendars › Export calendar) or the Booking.com extranet (Rates & Availability › Sync calendars › Export), copy the unit’s link and add it here with “Add link”."
msgstr "Uvoz (OTA → web-stranica): u Airbnbu (Dostupnost › Poveži kalendare › Izvezi kalendar) ili u Booking.com extranetu (Cijene i dostupnost › Sinkronizacija kalendara › Izvoz) kopirajte poveznicu jedinice i dodajte je ovdje gumbom „Dodaj poveznicu”."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Export (website → OTA): copy this unit’s “Export to Airbnb” / “Export to Booking.com” link and paste it into the same screen of that channel under “Import calendar”. Each channel gets its own link so its own bookings are never sent back to it."
msgstr "Izvoz (web-stranica → OTA): kopirajte poveznicu „Izvoz: Airbnb” / „Izvoz: Booking.com” ove jedinice i zalijepite je na istom zaslonu tog kanala pod „Uvezi kalendar”. Svaki kanal dobiva vlastitu poveznicu, pa mu se njegove rezervacije nikad ne šalju natrag."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Repeat for every unit. The links are secret: if one leaks, use “New export links” and paste the new link into the channels again."
msgstr "Ponovite za svaku jedinicu. Poveznice su tajne: ako neka procuri, upotrijebite „Nove poveznice za izvoz” i ponovno zalijepite novu poveznicu u kanale."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Ograničenja"

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "iCal only shares busy/free dates — no prices, minimum stay, guest names or messages."
msgstr "iCal dijeli samo zauzete/slobodne datume — bez cijena, minimalnog boravka, imena gostiju i poruka."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "There is always a delay: the website reads the channels every 15 minutes (and right before each website booking), but Airbnb and Booking.com decide themselves how often they read our link — sometimes only every few hours. In peak season consider manual confirmation of OTA bookings."
msgstr "Uvijek postoji kašnjenje: web-stranica čita kanale svakih 15 minuta (i neposredno prije svake rezervacije na web-stranici), ali Airbnb i Booking.com sami odlučuju koliko često čitaju našu poveznicu — ponekad tek svakih nekoliko sati. U glavnoj sezoni razmislite o ručnoj potvrdi OTA rezervacija."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "If an imported booking overlaps a website booking, it is shown in red on the calendar and on the dashboard, and an e-mail is sent. Nothing is cancelled automatically — resolve it with the guest and the channel."
msgstr "Ako se uvezena rezervacija preklapa s rezervacijom s web-stranice, prikazuje se crveno u kalendaru i na pregledu te se šalje e-mail. Ništa se ne otkazuje automatski — riješite to s gostom i kanalom."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Full guide (Croatian and English): docs/ical-setup.md in the plugin folder."
msgstr "Cijele upute (hrvatski i engleski): docs/ical-setup.md u mapi dodatka."

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Calendar sync (iCal)"
msgstr "Sinkronizacija kalendara (iCal)"

#: build/admin/settings.e9073e3b.js:16
msgid "Keeps Airbnb, Booking.com and the website from selling the same nights: busy dates are exchanged through secret calendar links."
msgstr "Sprječava da Airbnb, Booking.com i web-stranica prodaju iste noći: zauzeti datumi razmjenjuju se putem tajnih poveznica kalendara."

